{#- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
    Guidance Layer: AI Trace Targeted Rewrite Instructions
    --------------------------------------------------------------------------- -#}

Execute **targeted AI trace removal** on the following paragraphs. You may only eliminate the listed AI-generated traces without altering narrative content.

## Rewrite Constraints

- **Rewrite only the AI traces marked in the paragraphs below**. Do not add or remove plot points, and do not alter causal chains.
- Retain original POV, time markers, character perceptions, and narrative pacing.
- Dialogue content (text within「」/""/"" quotes) must not be modified.
- Do not introduce new AI writing patterns (such as rule of three, negative parallelism, significance inflation, etc.).
- After rewriting, the word count of each paragraph should not deviate more than ±20% from the original.
- If an AI trace is reasonable in context (such as rhetoric deliberately used by a character, or required by style specifications), retain it unchanged.

{% if humanize_context.cognitive_constraints | default([]) %}
